Third-party code in this repository
===================================

mcp-server/
-----------

Derived from Chat-Royale by Baighasan:
https://github.com/Baighasan/Chat-Royale

Several modules under `mcp-server/src/tools/` are copied from that project's
`src/mcp/src/tools/` with little or no modification. `analytics.py` is original
work added here.

Chat-Royale publishes no license file. Under default copyright that means no
rights to copy, modify, or redistribute it have been granted, so the MIT license
in this repository explicitly excludes `mcp-server/`, and no grant is offered or
implied for it.

This directory is not used by the dashboard or by the data pipeline. The only
reference to it from other code is the path `mcp-server/.env`, read for a
Clash Royale API key.


Clash Royale data and assets
----------------------------

Card data, images, and battle records are retrieved from the Supercell API and
remain Supercell's property, used under the Supercell Fan Content Policy:
https://supercell.com/en/fan-content-policy/

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored, or specifically
approved by Supercell, and Supercell is not responsible for it.
